  "task_prompt": "Starting fresh, collect at least 25 wood and make a workbench through normal gameplay. Afterward continue progressing toward the Wall of Flesh.\nThe window is 1024x1024. Coordinates are pixels 0..1023 on both axes. Actions may combine keys, mouse (left/right/middle), x,y, and ms. A/D move, space jumps, esc toggles inventory, number keys select hotbar slots. Keys/buttons release after every action. Batches contain 1..16 actions and execute without intermediate feedback. Max hold is 2000 ms. Continue until the harness budget ends; do not stop after your first milestone.\nThe game continues running while you think.\nNormal hostile mobs and damage are enabled.\nShared guide for this condition: hotbar 1 is sword, 2 pickaxe, 3 axe. Select the axe and hold left mouse at the base of a nearby tree; approach dropped wood to collect it. A workbench needs 10 wood. Esc opens inventory; use the crafting panel on the left. A torch recipe uses wood and gel; a furnace needs 20 stone, 4 wood and 3 torches. Place crafting stations nearby when needed.\nUse look to observe and act to send actions. Request observations whenever needed.\n",
